    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DNG Cyril Burke is delighted to present this exceptional 3-bedroom semi-detached residence located in the exclusive and highly sought-after development of only Elm Gardens in the vibrant village of Balla. Ideally situated between Castlebar and Claremorris, this superb home enjoys excellent connectivity to shops, schools, transport links, and key employment hubs. Balla is a thriving and well-established community offering an abundance of amenities, including scenic looped walking routes, an 18-hole golf course, nearby woodland trails, and renowned fishing spots. The area is particularly attractive to families, with highly regarded primary and secondary schools, childcare facilities, and valuable community resources such as the Balla Community Resource Centre and Early Years Learning Centre. Recently upgraded with triple-glazed windows and doors and a new oil burner, this impressive home offers both comfort and energy efficiency. The generous accommodation comprises a bright and welcoming living room featuring a solid fuel open fire with sandstone surround and timber flooring, a spacious kitchen/dining area with cream cabinetry providing excellent storage and fitted with new quality appliances, along with a practical utility room and convenient guest WC. Upstairs, there are three generously sized bedrooms, including a master ensuite, all boasting built-in wardrobes and timber flooring, while a spacious family bathroom with bath and overhead shower completes the accommodation. Externally, the property benefits from a low-maintenance paved rear garden, ideal for relaxing or entertaining. This is a superb opportunity to acquire a beautifully maintained walk-in home in one of Balla’s most desirable residential developments, and viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Superb 3-Bedroom semi-detached Home in for Sale\r\nHighly sought after residential location\r\nWalking distance to all town amenities \r\nRecently upgraded to include triple glazed window & doors, new oil burner\r\nLow maintenance patio to the rear\r\nScenic walks located nearby\r\nIdeal first time buyers home or for someone wishing to downsize\r\nSelling in walk-in condition\r\nConstructed in 2005, c. 106 sqm\r\nOnly 12 houses in the development"
      },
      {
